  ('1729', '[{"name":"Type","value":"ALIADO"},{"name":"Cost","value":"4"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"4"},{"name":"Race","value":"TITAN"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Helénica"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"REAL"},{"name":"Number","value":"LPB2-080-300"},{"name":"Format","value":"Primer Bloque"},{"name":"Slug","value":"prometeo"},{"name":"Effect","value":"<p>Prometeo puede atacar el turno que entra en juego. En respuesta a ser declarado atacante, puedes pagar 1 de oro para que sea imbloqueable hasta el final del turno.</p>"},{"name":"Mechanics","value":"Furia"},{"name":"Mechanics","value":"Bono Fuerza"},{"name":"Mechanics","value":"Imbloqueable"}]'::jsonb),
