  ('1750', '[{"name":"Type","value":"ALIADO"},{"name":"Cost","value":"2"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"4"},{"name":"Race","value":"ETERNO"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Dominios de RA"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"REAL"},{"name":"Number","value":"LPB2-101-300"},{"name":"Format","value":"Primer Bloque"},{"name":"Slug","value":"ptah"},{"name":"Effect","value":"<p>Ptah no puede ser declarado atacante. Cuando entra en juego tu oponente elige 6 cartas de tu Cementerio y las barajas en tu Mazo Castillo.</p>"},{"name":"Mechanics","value":"Guardián"},{"name":"Mechanics","value":"Barajar"}]'::jsonb),
