  ('1758', '[{"name":"Type","value":"ARMA"},{"name":"Cost","value":"3"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"0"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Dominios de RA"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"REAL"},{"name":"Number","value":"LPB2-109-300"},{"name":"Format","value":"Primer Bloque"},{"name":"Slug","value":"sakraham"},{"name":"Effect","value":"<p>El portador de Sakraham gana 2 a la fuerza yl es Imbloqueable. En respuesta a que el portador haga daño al Mazo Castillo oponente, puedes robar una carta. </p>"}]'::jsonb),
  ('1939', '[{"name":"Type","value":"TOTEM"},{"name":"Cost","value":"2"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"0"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Dominios de RA"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"VASALLO"},{"name":"Number","value":"LPB2-290-300"},{"name":"Format","value":"Primer Bloque"},{"name":"Slug","value":"saqqara"},{"name":"Effect","value":"<p>En respuesta a un ataque oponente, puedes desterrar a Saqqara para cancelarlo.</p>"}]'::jsonb),
