  ('3510', '[{"name":"Type","value":"ORO"},{"name":"Cost","value":"0"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"0"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Helénica"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"PROMOCIONAL"},{"name":"Number","value":"PROMO-AHE-02-04"},{"name":"Format","value":"Primer Bloque"},{"name":"Slug","value":"imperio"},{"name":"Effect","value":"Oro sin habilidad."}]'::jsonb),
  ('3511', '[{"name":"Type","value":"TOTEM"},{"name":"Cost","value":"3"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"0"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Helénica"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"PROMOCIONAL"},{"name":"Number","value":"PROMO-AHE-03-04"},{"name":"Format","value":"Primer Bloque"},{"name":"Slug","value":"micenas"},{"name":"Effect","value":"<p>Mientras Micenas esté en juego, el coste de las cartas de anulación o en respuesta de tu oponente aumenta en 2.</p>"}]'::jsonb),
  ('48965', '[{"name":"Type","value":"TALISMAN"},{"name":"Cost","value":"0"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"0"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Explorandum"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"PROMOCIONAL"},{"name":"Number","value":"EXP-322"},{"name":"Format","value":"Imperio"},{"name":"Slug","value":"grito-de-auxilio"},{"name":"Effect","value":"Busca dos Aliados de distinto nombre en tu Castillo y ponlos en tu mano.<br />Si juegas alguno de esos Aliados este turno, puedes Barajar una carta oponente que no sea Oro."}]'::jsonb),
