  ('2071', '[{"name":"Type","value":"TALISMAN"},{"name":"Cost","value":"2"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"0"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Dominios de RA"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"REAL"},{"name":"Number","value":"TKP2-15-15"},{"name":"Format","value":"Primer Bloque"},{"name":"Slug","value":"revivir-a-osiris"},{"name":"Effect","value":"<p>Baraja 2 cartas de tu Cementerio en tu Mazo Castillo y roba 1 carta. Luego, tu oponente bota 1 carta de su Mazo Castillo por cada Revivir a Osiris en tu Cementerio.</p>"},{"name":"Mechanics","value":"Barajar"},{"name":"Mechanics","value":"Robar"},{"name":"Mechanics","value":"Daño Directo"}]'::jsonb),
