  ('4690', '[{"name":"Type","value":"TALISMAN"},{"name":"Cost","value":"1"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"0"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Espada Sagrada"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"REAL"},{"name":"Number","value":"CLESP-10"},{"name":"Format","value":"Primer Bloque"},{"name":"Slug","value":"fe-sin-limite"},{"name":"Effect","value":"<p>Anula un Talismán.</p>"}]'::jsonb),
