  ('4699', '[{"name":"Type","value":"TALISMAN"},{"name":"Cost","value":"2"},{"name":"Fuerza","value":"0"},{"name":"Edition","value":"Helénica"},{"name":"Frequency","value":"REAL"},{"name":"Number","value":"CLHEP-09"},{"name":"Format","value":"Primer Bloque"},{"name":"Slug","value":"siete-contra-tebas"},{"name":"Effect","value":"<p>Cancela la Habilidad de una carta oponente en juego que no sea Oro. Luego, puedes robar 1 carta de tu Mazo Castillo.</p>"}]'::jsonb),
